	(text "Changes from Lyra Pi schematic:\nPHYAD strap resistors (R31/R32 from Lyra Pi) \nnot required. CH182H2 internal pulls set PHY \naddress 0x01:\n  PA0 (pin 24, LED0): internal pull-UP → 1\n  PA1 (pin 25, LED1): internal pull-DOWN → 0\nRJ45 LEDs are open-circuit during strap sampling\n(no current path through R25/R26), so internal\npulls are not overridden.\n\nR1, R2, R8 & R10 omitted\nED1 & ED2 omitted\nR12 & C8 built into J1\nDespite annotation Lyra Pi schematic\nappears to use CH182H1. As a result: \n - Difference in COL & RMII pins.\n - R53 Not required"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 234.95 40.386 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e3f4ad72-a012-44ce-ad17-6916d3722aad")
	)
